# Single source of truth for the Foundry version this repository pins.
#
# Consumed by:
#   - .github/actions/install-foundry  (all CI workflows)
#   - recompute_hashes.sh              (local artifact + hash regeneration)
#   - .github/workflows/build-docker-base.yaml, build-docker.yaml
#     (passed to docker/protocol/Dockerfile{,.base} as build args)
#
# Keep this file shell-sourceable: `KEY=value`, no spaces, no expansion.

# One version for forge, cast and anvil alike. Three separate pins used to live
# here — build, anvil and scripts — which is exactly the drift that lets a
# difference slip through untested, so they are deliberately collapsed.
#
# Bumping this changes solc metadata in every artifact, so regenerate
# `AllContractsHashes.json` in the same PR (via the 'Update Hashes in PR'
# workflow). `zkstack-out` is ABI-only and measured unaffected. Anvil's trace
# schema has to stay compatible with the committed chain states under
# l1-contracts/test/anvil-interop; if a bump changes it, regenerate them with
# the 'Regenerate Anvil Interop Chain States' workflow.
FOUNDRY_VERSION=v1.5.1
# Release commit of FOUNDRY_VERSION, asserted by recompute_hashes.sh.
FOUNDRY_COMMIT=b0a9dd9ce
